hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3086","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Jibril (peace be upon him) came and said: 'How do you regard those among you who took part in Badr?' I said: 'The best of us.' He said: 'Likewise, those of the angels who took part in Badr are, in our view too, the best of the angels.'"""
"3087","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The neighbour of a house has more right to that house than others."""
"3088","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The neighbour of a house has more right to pre-emption (shuf'ah)."""
"3089","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The neighbour of a house has more right to his neighbour's house."""
"3090","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Strive (do jihad) against the polytheists with your wealth, your lives, and your tongues."""
"3091","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""May Allah Almighty reward the Ansar with the best on our behalf, especially Abdullah bin Amr bin Haram and Sa'd bin Ubadah."""
"3092","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Trim the moustaches and let the beards grow; be different from the Magians."""
"3093","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty has made the new moons a means of marking times for people. So fast upon sighting it and end the fast upon sighting it, and if it is clouded over for you, then complete thirty days."""
"3094","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty has made the reward of a good deed ten times its like; so fasting one month equals ten months, and fasting six days after that month completes the year."""
"3095","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty made mercy into one hundred parts. He kept ninety-nine parts with Himself and sent down one part to the earth. Because of that one part, creation shows mercy to one another, so much so that a mare lifts her hoof away from her foal for fear of hurting it."""
"3096","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty has placed the punishment of this Ummah in its worldly life."""
"3097","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty has placed upon you the prayer of righteous people who stand in prayer at night and fast during the day, who are neither sinners nor wicked."""
"3098","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The coolness of my eyes has been placed in prayer."""
"3099","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The earth has been made for me a place of prostration and a means of purification."""
"3100","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Every pure piece of earth has been made for me a place of prostration and a means of purification."""
"3101","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Two gardens are of silver, their vessels and whatever is in them, and two gardens are of gold, their vessels and whatever is in them. And in the Garden of Eden, nothing will stand between the people and their seeing their Lord except the cloak of majesty upon His Face."""
"3102","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Your jihad is Hajj."""
"3103","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""A neighbour has the greater right to his neighbour's right of pre-emption (shuf'ah); he is to be waited for even if he is absent, provided that their path is one and the same."""
"3104","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""A neighbour has the greater right to the adjoining house of his neighbour."""
"3105","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The one who recites the Qur'an aloud is like the one who gives charity openly, and the one who recites the Qur'an quietly is like the one who gives charity secretly."""
"3106","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Disputing about the Qur'an is disbelief."""
"3107","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The bell is the musical instrument of Satan."""
"3108","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""A sacrificial camel suffices on behalf of seven people."""
"3109","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Unity is mercy and division is punishment."""
"3110","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The period between one Friday (Jumu'ah) and the next is an expiation for sins, provided that major sins are not committed."""
"3111","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Performing the Friday prayer in congregation is an obligatory duty upon every Muslim, except for four: a slave, a woman, a child, or a sick person."""
"3112","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The Friday prayer is obligatory upon the one who hears the call (adhan)."""
"3113","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The Friday prayer is obligatory, except upon a woman, a child, a sick person, or a slave."""
"3114","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The jinn are of three kinds: one kind has wings with which they fly through the air, one kind is in the form of snakes and dogs, and one kind stays in places and travels on."""
"3115","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise is closer to any one of you than the strap of his sandal, and the Fire is likewise just as close."""
"3116","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The construction of Paradise is one brick of silver and one brick of gold; its mortar is fragrant musk, its pebbles are pearls and rubies, and its soil is saffron. Whoever enters it will live in bliss and never suffer hardship, and will live forever and never die; their garments will not wear out and their youth will not fade."""
"3117","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise is beneath the shade of swords."""
"3118","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise is one brick of gold and one brick of silver."""
"3119","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise has eight gates and Hell has seven gates."""
"3120","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise has one hundred levels; the distance between every two levels is like the distance between the heaven and the earth."""
"3121","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Paradise has one hundred levels; the distance between every two levels is like the distance between the heaven and the earth. Al-Firdaws is the highest and the middlemost part of Paradise, above it is the Throne of the Most Merciful, and from it the rivers of Paradise gush forth. So when you ask Allah, ask Him for al-Firdaws."""
